WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:05.660
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No changing the standard-issue

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.660
D-Class uniform!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:11.630
Dr. Bright is always proposing changes at
the SCP Foundation, and nearly all of them

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.380
should be disregarded immediately.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.910
The D-Class uniform is perfect the way it
is, and does not need to be changed.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.519
It especially does not need to be changed
to black pants with a red polo shirt.

00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:24.300
We get what you're going for, Dr. Bright.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.399
It's very clever, we also enjoy Star Trek.

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:32.570
But in addition to it being a waste of resources
to produce all of those new uniforms, we just

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.989
don't want a lawsuit from Paramount Global
on our hands.

